      "options": {
        "content": "### ⚠️ Biometric & Algorithmic Notice: FaceNet 512D Cosine Distance\n\n- **Metric Definition**: Facial comparison telemetry represents mathematical similarity based on Euclidean/Cosine distance between 512-dimensional vector embeddings generated by DeepFace/FaceNet.\n- **Verification vs Authenticity**: A low mathematical distance demonstrates feature similarity between the cropped ID portrait and the live selfie. **It does not independently establish absolute legal identity authenticity.**\n- **Anti-Spoofing & Liveness Disclaimer**: In accordance with the system specification, standard webcam capture **does not perform 3D structured-light depth sensing or passive anti-spoofing analysis**. It cannot eliminate replay or high-quality physical presentation attacks without downstream administrative human-in-the-loop compliance review.",
